[[Open This|2.1 Hardware]]

---

https://docs.oxide.computer/guides/quickstart#_hardware

Under Hardware you have the option to set up a pre-configured choice — a high CPU instance, a high memory instance, or a general purpose instance — or to set your own CPU and memory values. Leave it on the default of 2 vCPUs and 8 GiB RAM.

